# the comment at :L25 (列类型, "column type").
# These spellings travel in serialized payloads, log records and characterization recordings, so a
# rename would silently invalidate every stored comparison.
# THE STYLE SEQUENCE SKIPS SIX, AND THAT GAP IS LEGACY AND NOT A TRANSCRIPTION SLIP. STYLE_RICHTEXT is
# 7 [:L24] and no constant carries the value 6; the legacy declares no name for it, so neither does
# this file, and a reader must not close the gap by renumbering. STYLE_DEFAULT likewise covers FOUR
# PowerBuilder styles at one value - form, group, query and tabular [:L18] - which is why it is named
# for none of them and why no separate "tabular" constant exists to be added.
# THE SCOPE OF THIS SECTION IS THIS ONE FILE, DELIBERATELY. The band's maintenance rule forbids
# broadening the glob, and a Domain/ wildcard would suppress the naming diagnostics for every file in
