# away: every one of the seven consumption sites is an equality or inequality (:L45, :L49, :L52,
# :L92, :L106, :L175, :L277) and not one is a bit test, so RS_SINGLE + RS_MULTIPLE equals neither
# constant and reaches a THIRD behavioural path - which is the value the oracle's own fixture sets
