# Preserved verbatim: the nine reserved context-menu command identifiers MID_RESERVED=10000
# (保留的开始ID, "the reserved start id"), MID_COLAUTOWIDTH=10000 (自动列宽, "auto column width"),
# MID_COLAUTOWIDTH_ALL=10001, MID_COLCHECK=10002, MID_COLUNCHECK=10003, MID_COLREVERTCHECK=10004,
# MID_COLCOPY=10005, MID_COLPASTE=10006 and MID_ITEMCOPY=10007, plus the two private literals
# ARROW_BTN_WIDTH=18 and PRP_POPUPMENUCREATOR="{DWSVC_POPUPMENU_CREATOR}".
# Source: ws_objects/pfw.datawindow.services.pbl.src/n_cst_dwsvc_contextmenu.sru:L37-L45 (the nine
# ids, under the `public:` block) and :L64-L65 (the two private literals, under the `private:` block
# opened at :L62). A search of enums.sru for MID_ or for ARROW_BTN_WIDTH returns nothing, so all
# eleven are declared on this file rather than arriving with Shared.Kernel's constant catalogue - the
# same finding the two sections above record for the sort and row-select services.
# A MENU ID CROSSES THE WIRE ON EVERY SELECTION, so these spellings travel in serialized payloads,
# log records and characterization recordings and a rename would silently invalidate every stored
# comparison. CA1707 reports externally-visible declarations only, so strictly the nine ids need it
# and the two private literals do not; IDE1006 is a style rule that applies regardless of
# accessibility, so both diagnostics are named here for all eleven.
# MID_RESERVED AND MID_COLAUTOWIDTH ARE BOTH 10000 - the same aliasing pattern as
# RetCode.OK/SUCCESS/ALLOW, and suppressing the naming diagnostic here must not be read as licence to
# de-duplicate them. They are separate `const uint` fields and deliberately NOT enum members, because
# two enum members of one value invite a "cleanup" that deletes a name the oracle declares. The
# observable consequence is that OnDefProc's dispatch has a `case MID_COLAUTOWIDTH` arm [:L206], so
# MID_RESERVED is unreachable as a distinct case.
[services/dataservices-service/PowerFramework.DataServices/Services/ContextMenuModel.cs]
dotnet_diagnostic.CA1707.severity = none
dotnet_diagnostic.IDE1006.severity = none

# Preserved verbatim: the drop-down search filter-type bitmask FILTER_DISP=1 (Display列, the display
# column), FILTER_DISP_PY=2 (Display列以输入数据的拼音首字母过滤, the display column matched by the
# Pinyin first letters of the input), FILTER_DATA=4 (Data列, the data column) and FILTER_ALL, which the
# oracle declares as the COMPUTED SUM FILTER_DISP + FILTER_DISP_PY + FILTER_DATA rather than as the
# literal 7 - the .NET port preserves the expression form so the derivation survives in the code. All
# four are declared on the drop-down search service itself rather than in the framework-wide constant
# catalogue: a search of enums.sru for any of the four names returns nothing, so in the .NET tree they
# belong to this file, and Configuration/DataServicesOptions.cs deliberately spells the FilterType
# default as the numeric literal 3 rather than referencing them. That is the same finding the
# row-select service's RS_* constants and the sort service's SORT_*/ARROWSUFFIX constants produced.
# Source: ws_objects/pfw.datawindow.services.pbl.src/n_cst_dwsvc_dropdownsearch.sru:L49-L53, declared
# under the comment at :L49 that the type "supports combination", with the default assigned at :L57.
# These spellings travel in serialized payloads, log records and characterization recordings, so a
# rename would silently invalidate every stored comparison. TWO CAUTIONS THAT MUST NOT BE TIDIED AWAY
# BY ANYONE ACTING ON THIS SUPPRESSION. First, the default IS NOT FILTER_ALL: it is FILTER_DISP +
# FILTER_DISP_PY, that is 3, because the oracle deliberately omits the data-column bit. Second,
# FILTER_ALL evaluates to 7 and the Pinyin flags argument at :L323 is ALSO 7, and the two are unrelated
# values in unrelated domains - the latter decomposes per enums.sru:L1147-L1149 as
# PY_LIKE_IGNORE_CASE + PY_LIKE_IGNORE_WIDTH + PY_LIKE_FUZZY_SOUND - so neither may ever be derived
# from the other. The three broker topic constants in the same file are private, and CA1707 reports
# externally-visible declarations only, so they need nothing further.
[services/dataservices-service/PowerFramework.DataServices/Services/DropDownSearchModel.cs]
dotnet_diagnostic.CA1707.severity = none
dotnet_diagnostic.IDE1006.severity = none

